╭─ oge · demo · main ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Describe the task                                                            │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
   { · }                expanded: previous · next Attempt
   esc                  close the search, then collapse
   ctrl+c               cancel the Run (twice: force Öge to stop)
 Delivery
   ↓ on an empty box    the actions of the last Run
   a · b · d · r        apply · branch · diff · receipt (each ↓ allows one)
 Setup
   tab · esc            close setup
   ↑ ↓ · enter          move · change the row
   s · w                save as default · write the project Checks
   d · x                remove the row
 Vim (when enabled)
   esc · i a I A o O    NORMAL · INSERT (enter runs in both)
   h j k l              left · down · up · right (NORMAL)
   w e b                next word · word end · previous (NORMAL)
   0 ^ $                line start · first char · end (NORMAL)
   d c y                operator + motion or iw i" i( · dd cc yy (NORMAL)
   x · D                delete the character · to the line end (NORMAL)
   p · P                put after · before (the kill ring)
   u · .                undo · repeat the last change
 ↑ ↓ scroll (35-54 of 54) · esc or ? close
